repository-code: https://github.com/SoluceTechnologies/nextcloud-calendar-mobile
url: https://soluce-technologies.com
abstract: >-
  Nextcloud Calendar Mobile brings your Nextcloud calendars natively to iOS and
  Android. It connects directly to your Nextcloud instance via the CalDAV
  protocol, supporting multiple accounts, rich event management, and deep
  Nextcloud integration, including Talk room creation per event.
